# Jira Report

Commit the sanitized evaluation source under `submission/global-skills/platformclaw-jira-report/`. Keep `SKILL.md`, scripts, references, assets and tests together there. This template directory is not an actual source root.

Use the Run ID, correlation ID, source commit, artifact digest, board result and sanitized evidence references.

1. Validate the approved project and issue schema.
2. Build a bounded summary without credentials or private infrastructure details.
3. Create or update idempotently using the Run correlation key.
4. Return the issue key, safe reference and delivery result.
5. On failure, preserve all prior Run and hardware evidence.

Do not attach raw logs until the masking policy has approved them.
